  "description": "One second you’re standing safely on solid ground, the next you’re dodging alien ships, lava floods, and the legendary wrath of Tung Tung Tung Sahur and Tralalelo Tralala. Every round brings a new disaster, a new map, and a fresh chance to yell “I totally dodged that!” before flying into oblivion.\n\nCollect survival gear like jetpacks and speed boosts, customize your look with flashy outfits and effects, and prove you’ve got the fastest reflexes this side of the apocalypse. The “Apocalypse” bonus levels crank everything up to 11—expect chaos, laughter, and maybe a few rage respawns.\n\nWhether it’s dodging meteors, escaping floods, or surviving meme-level destruction, one thing’s for sure—this world isn’t ending quietly.\n\nBecause in this game, “the floor is lava” isn’t a joke, it’s just Tuesday.",
